message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MFI Portfolio Analytics: Microfinance Analytics for Bangladesh"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Khan"
    given-names: "Khalilur Rahman Ridoy"
    alias: "khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/mfi-portfolio-analytics"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Microfinance analytics for Bangladesh in two clearly separated layers: real
  institution-level statistics for 693 licensed MFIs from the Microcredit Regulatory
  Authority, and a calibrated synthetic loan book for portfolio-at-risk, vintage, roll-rate
  and savings analysis, with an interactive dashboard.
keywords:
  - microfinance
  - financial inclusion
  - portfolio at risk
  - Bangladesh
  - synthetic data
